  {
    "id": "2022991423696699417",
    "author": {
      "id": "1725169104963657728",
      "username": "AztecaAlpaca",
      "name": "阿兹特克小羊驼",
      "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019350943930937348/0z3zAknf_400x400.jpg",
      "verified": false
    },
    "text": "最近做日报，新闻报道中的AI参与让我感到不安。\n\n观点性的东西倒还可以接受，但事实性谬误就完全不能忍了。但我也没有特别好的办法，唯一有点用的做法就是保持信息的可追溯性，我的工作就是起到一点桥梁作用。\n\n现在难免陷入一种自我怀疑，不知道用AI来批处理AI垃圾的意义何在🤣 https://t.co/87ciA9mSH7",
    "created_at": "2026-02-15T11:08:35.000Z",
    "metrics": {
      "like_count": 3,
      "retweet_count": 0,
      "reply_count": null,
      "quote_count": null,
      "view_count": null,
      "impression_count": null
    },
    "media": null,
    "entities": {
      "urls": [
        {
          "url": "https://t.co/87ciA9mSH7",
          "indices": [
            135,
            158
          ],
          "display_url": "x.com/BenShindel/sta…",
          "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BenShindel/status/2022869264928227738"
